COPY outdateddbsnapshotoct2024.poems (poem_id, theme_tag, line1, line2, line3, line4, source, created_at, updated_at) FROM stdin;
1	vetted_friends	Vetted and verified, but waiting for you,	To find a connection that's honest and true.	Send a sweet bloom or a thoughtful "Hi,"	You never know who might catch your eye.	seed	2026-05-09 20:46:07.925695-04	2026-05-09 20:46:07.925695-04
2	vetted_friends	Within this circle, every face is a friend,	A new beginning on which you can depend.	Let a flower speak what words cannot say,	And brighten a special soul's world today.	seed	2026-05-09 20:46:07.925695-04	2026-05-09 20:46:07.925695-04
3	vetted_friends	A gated garden of souls, trusted and fine,	Where paths of two hearts begin to entwine.	Plant a seed with a chat, let a flower be the sign,	That you've found a connection truly divine.	seed	2026-05-09 20:46:07.925695-04	2026-05-09 20:46:07.925695-04
4	vetted_friends	Hand-picked friends, curated for you,	Authentic connections, honest and true.	Reach out with a message to see where it leads,	A flower is the simplest of romantic deeds.	seed	2026-05-09 20:46:07.925695-04	2026-05-09 20:46:07.925695-04
5	vetted_friends	In this quiet corner where trust is the key,	Discover the person you're meant to meet.	A flower for a smile, a message for a start,	The shortest distance between two hearts.	seed	2026-05-09 20:46:07.925695-04	2026-05-09 20:46:07.925695-04
6	vetted_friends	No strangers here, only friends you've yet to meet,	Making the journey of love a little more sweet.	Send a bloom to show interest, or chat for a while,	There's no better feeling than sparking a smile.	seed	2026-05-09 20:46:07.925695-04	2026-05-09 20:46:07.925695-04
7	vetted_friends	A circle of trust, a gallery of hearts,	This is where your next story starts.	Share a word, let a conversation grow,	Or send a flower to let a special someone know.	seed	2026-05-09 20:46:07.925695-04	2026-05-09 20:46:07.925695-04
8	vetted_friends	Real people, real hearts, and a space to belong,	Where a simple "hello" can turn into a song.	Strike up a chat or send a flower today,	And let a new friendship lead the way.	seed	2026-05-09 20:46:07.925695-04	2026-05-09 20:46:07.925695-04
9	vetted_friends	Verified hearts in a peaceful place,	Finding the beauty in every face.	Whisper a message or send a bouquet,	To brighten the world in a beautiful way.	seed	2026-05-09 20:46:07.925695-04	2026-05-09 20:46:07.925695-04
10	vetted_friends	Beyond the screen and the verified name,	Lies a spark waiting to turn into a flame.	Say hello through chat, or if you're feeling bold,	Send a digital bloom and let a new bond unfold.	seed	2026-05-09 20:46:07.925695-04	2026-05-09 20:46:07.925695-04
11	vetted_friends	Carefully chosen, specifically for you,	A circle of people, authentic and true.	Let a flower speak softly or a conversation start,	Open the door to a vetted friend's heart.	seed	2026-05-09 20:46:07.925695-04	2026-05-09 20:46:07.925695-04
12	vetted_friends	Vetted and verified, but waiting for you.	To find a connection that's honest and true.	Send a sweet bloom or a thoughtful "Hi,"	You never know who might catch your eye.	seed	2026-05-09 20:52:13.880088-04	2026-05-09 20:52:13.880088-04
